{"id":"646968","name":"凉拌菠菜","author":"polaris滴食记","authorId":"10301589","desc":"","cover":"images/646968/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"菠菜","amount":"300克"}],"sub":[{"name":"奇亚籽","amount":"1小搓"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备食材：菠菜300克洗净，味达美初榨原酿生抽15毫升。","img":"images/646968/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"锅内放入适量的清水煮开。","img":"images/646968/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"倒入洗净的菠菜。","img":"images/646968/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"汆烫2分钟。","img":"images/646968/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"捞出沥干水分装入盘中。","img":"images/646968/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"倒入1勺（15毫升）味达美初榨原酿生抽。","img":"images/646968/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"搅拌均匀。","img":"images/646968/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"装入盘中。","img":"images/646968/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"撒上一些奇亚籽点缀。","img":"images/646968/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"一道快手简单的养生凉拌菜。","img":"images/646968/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"菠菜建议汆烫之后再食用，可以去除草酸，有利于营养的吸收。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}